   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Are you saying that this doesn&#39;t run on Shiny Server? If so, make sure that the packages are not only installed, but installed either in the machine-wide library OR as the user who is actually going to run the app (by default this is an account named &quot;shiny&quot;). If you just log in with your regular SSH account and install, then you&#39;ll just be installing it in your own personal library.<div><br></div><div>Switch to <i>either</i> root:</div><div>sudo su -</div><div><br></div><div>or shiny:<br></div><div>sudo su - shiny</div><div><br></div><div>Then launch R and install the packages you want.</div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
